  <data key="d2">The Belt and Road Initiative (BRI), also known as "One Belt One Road," is a global development strategy proposed by China. This initiative aims to enhance connectivity and cooperation among countries along and beyond the ancient Silk Road economic belt and the 21st-century Maritime Silk Road. It encompasses a multi-lateral cooperation initiative focused on promoting global infrastructure development and economic cooperation. Specifically, the BRI seeks to foster economic collaboration and development among the nations situated along the Silk Road Economic Belt and the 21st Century Maritime Silk Road.&lt;SEP&gt;一带一路倡议是中国提出的一项倡议，旨在加强国际合作，促进共同发展。&lt;SEP&gt;The Belt and Road Initiative</data>
