  <data key="d2">EPC总承包业务 is a comprehensive business model that encompasses the entire spectrum of project management, including engineering, procurement, and construction services. This model is designed to provide a holistic approach to project execution, covering the planning, engineering, procurement, construction, and commissioning phases. It is a service-oriented business that offers a streamlined process for clients, ensuring that all aspects of a project are managed efficiently under one contract. The EPC总承包 business involves the design, procurement, and construction of projects, with a focus on delivering a complete solution from start to finish. This model is recognized as a comprehensive service model in project management, often referred to as a general contracting business, emphasizing its role in managing all aspects of a project's lifecycle. It is a type of business model where a single entity is responsible for the design, procurement, and construction of a project. EPC总承包业务 is also a core business of Hualu Engineering Technology Co., Ltd., and is a dynamic and evolving "galaxy" of services. Additionally, it is one of the business activities conducted by Zhongnan Institute, involving a diverse range of project types. The EPC general contracting business in a project refers to the integration of design, procurement, and construction services, which is a fundamental aspect of the company's core business operations. The model is particularly prominent in the business of China Iron and Steel Group Southern Engineering Technology Co., Ltd., reflecting its role in the company's multi-domain coordinated development. This model involves a full chain of activities, including design management, global procurement, construction organization, and debugging operation. The EPC总承包 business model involves a contractor who is fully responsible for the quality, safety, schedule, and cost of the project. This model is characterized by a single entity's responsibility for the design, procurement of materials, and construction of a project, providing a unified and efficient approach to project management. The model is particularly relevant in the field of power engineering. It is also a primary business domain for China Petroleum Engineering Corporation (CPECC). EPC总承包业务 refers to the process of managing all aspects of a project, from engineering to construction, under a single contract, ensuring a seamless and integrated approach to project execution.</data>
