<node id="技术创新">
  <data key="d0">技术创新</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Technological innovation, often referred to as "技术创新" in Chinese, is a multifaceted process that encompasses the development and implementation of new technologies. This process involves research and development activities aimed at creating new technologies and applying them to enhance products, services, and processes. The primary objectives of technological innovation are to increase efficiency, create new value, and enhance the competitiveness of products and services. This activity is not limited to enterprises alone, as it can also extend to the broader industry through the study and development of new technologies. The end goal of technological innovation is to drive industry development and foster the creation of new or improved products, services, or processes through the use of technology.

Technological innovation is a critical component in the core competitiveness of companies like Hualu Engineering Technology Co., Ltd., where it serves as one of the "planet" support systems within their EPC (Engineering, Procurement, and Construction)总承包 business. It is a concept that supports the company's ability to deliver high-quality projects efficiently. In summary, technological innovation is a dynamic process that involves the research, development, and application of new technologies to improve efficiency, create value, and enhance competitiveness across various industries. This concept is integral to the advancement of technology in the technical field, encompassing a wide range of innovation activities. Additionally, technological innovation refers to the invention and application of new technologies, underscoring its role in driving progress and innovation.

Technological innovation is defined as the process of improving product and service technology levels through scientific research and technological development. It is characterized by innovation activities in the technical field, emphasizing the importance of technological advancements in enhancing project efficiency and quality.</data>
