<node id="星系战略框架">
  <data key="d0">星系战略框架</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The 星系战略框架 is a comprehensive strategic framework designed for analyzing business. It serves as an innovative analytical model that encompasses the strategic layout, business composition, support system, innovation path, and risk challenges of various entities, such as the Shandong Institute. This framework is particularly applied to analyze the collaborative relationships and value creation mechanisms of a company's business segments within the context of the business ecosystem. Recognized as a national think tank-level strategic recommendation, the 星系战略 framework aims to assist Hualu Company in building a sustained competitive advantage and leading the new era of engineering construction. It is a strategic analysis framework that guides the development of enterprises and is used to analyze the business landscape and competitive advantages of companies. Additionally, it is referred to as a strategic analysis tool and has been used to analyze the macro strategic positioning, strategic choices, and strategic implementation of enterprises, including the macro strategic evolution of CPECC. The framework is also known by its English translation, Galactic strategic framework.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-655a7b6ada23333c4b36a74d4c7768d1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-655a7b6ada23333c4b36a74d4c7768d1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2434be21f9a4cab7742c6bd9e8e2f4ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e372fae4139a56afb147dd651580dc3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2e372fae4139a56afb147dd651580dc3-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4b4a2e6a92f9c37a7eda682f79ba873b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4b4a2e6a92f9c37a7eda682f79ba873b-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-716e5b1a644ad0022b77a1f1c453a4f2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-716e5b1a644ad0022b77a1f1c453a4f2-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79f54ecf387b35cfbcb780658cda7e0c-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79f54ecf387b35cfbcb780658cda7e0c-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d19777aff1f7b27fad9d73af393b32b0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d19777aff1f7b27fad9d73af393b32b0-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d19777aff1f7b27fad9d73af393b32b0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fc67e06ce2ff217d4ff116fc60940b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f1fc67e06ce2ff217d4ff116fc60940b-chunk-004</data>
