  <data key="d0">高质量发展</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">High-quality development, referred to as "高质量发展" in Chinese, represents a strategic phase for various entities, including the Shanghai Municipal Engineering Design Institute, the Chengdu Institute, and the China Metallurgical Group Corporation's Southern Engineering Technical Co., Ltd. This concept is guided by Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics for a New Era and is characterized by a focus on sustainability and efficiency. It signifies a pursuit of development goals in the construction engineering industry, aiming for both economic growth and environmental responsibility. High-quality development is a multifaceted approach that encompasses the principles of sustainable and efficient growth, reflecting a commitment to long-term viability and social welfare.</data>
