  <data key="d2">Design is a multifaceted process that encompasses the creation of blueprints or models for projects or products. It is a term that can be used to describe the engineering design process, which involves the process of designing itself. This creative process is focused on developing plans or specifications for a project, leading to the creation of plans and drawings that are essential for the project's execution. Specifically, design is a critical component of the engineering, procurement, and construction (EPC) model, where it is integral to every stage of the project's lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;Design&lt;SEP&gt;工程项目的设计阶段</data>
