  <data key="d2">The entity referred to as "业主" is the owner or investor of a project. As the owner, they are responsible for proposing the fundamental requirements of the project and paying the contract amounts. The owner is an individual or entity that organizes and manages the project, often delegating the construction work to a general contractor. In the context of the Engineering, Procurement, and Construction (EPC)总承包 model, the owner acts as the contracting party and is responsible for interfacing with the general contractor and managing the project. The owner can be either a person or an organization, and they are the party that delegates the construction work to the general contractor.&lt;SEP&gt;业主是电力工程项目的投资方和最终使用者。&lt;SEP&gt;Owners of electric power projects&lt;SEP&gt;指企业的业主&lt;SEP&gt;涉及获取项目业主信息</data>
